Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/digitwolf/motanka
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/digitwolf/motanka
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/digitwolf/motanka.git

Package: motanka-stack-libs
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
#if resolute
         libstdc++6 (>= 16-20260322),
#endif
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Hyprland stack for Motanka - libraries
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its Stack is
 the Hyprland compositor with its companion programs and libraries at the
 versions upstream Omarchy expects, installed under /opt/motanka.
 .
 This package holds the Stack libraries in /opt/motanka/lib: the Hypr*
 libraries and, on Ubuntu 24.04, newer builds of the Wayland, input and
 C++ runtime libraries. Programs find them through RUNPATH; nothing outside
 /opt/motanka sees them.

Package: motanka-stack-hyprland
Architecture: amd64
Depends: motanka-stack-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
         xkb-data,
         xwayland,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: libgl1-mesa-dri,
Description: Hyprland stack for Motanka - compositor
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its Stack is
 the Hyprland compositor with its companion programs and libraries at the
 versions upstream Omarchy expects, installed under /opt/motanka.
 .
 This package holds Hyprland, start-hyprland, hyprctl, the Hyprland GUI
 utilities and, where the release allows it, the desktop portal backend.
 It does not replace or change Ubuntu's own hyprland package.

Package: motanka-stack-tools
Architecture: amd64
Depends: motanka-stack-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
         python3,
         python3-dbus,
         python3-xdg,
         util-linux-extra,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: whiptail,
Description: Hyprland stack for Motanka - companion programs
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its Stack is
 the Hyprland compositor with its companion programs and libraries at the
 versions upstream Omarchy expects, installed under /opt/motanka.
 .
 This package holds hyprlock, hypridle, hyprpicker, hyprsunset,
 hyprcursor-util and uwsm, the session manager upstream Omarchy uses.

Package: motanka-stack
Architecture: amd64
Section: metapackages
Depends: motanka-stack-hyprland (= ${binary:Version}),
         motanka-stack-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
         motanka-stack-tools (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Hyprland stack for Motanka (metapackage)
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its Stack is
 the Hyprland compositor with its companion programs and libraries at the
 versions upstream Omarchy expects, installed under /opt/motanka.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the Stack libraries, the compositor and the
 companion programs.
